OL,3,AUS-Canada trade war escalates as Trump
OL,4,Athreatens tariff hike on vehicles
OL,5,
OL,6,FPresident Donald Trump has threatened
OL,7,Fto hike US tariffs on automobiles
OL,8,Foriginating in Canada, as the trade war
OL,9,Fbetween the two neighbours continues to
OL,10,Fheat up.
OL,12,FTrump said on Monday that he will
OL,13,Fincrease tariffs on Canadian cars and
OL,14,Ftrucks, as well as auto parts, from 25%
OL,15,Fto 50% as of 1 January.
OL,17,FIt comes after US-Canada trade talks
OL,18,Fcollapsed late last week, with each
OL,19,Fside accusing the other of making
OL,20,Funreasonable last-minute demands.
OL,23,APub: 24-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
