OL,3,AUS-Canada trade war escalates as Trump
OL,4,Athreatens tariff hike on vehicles
OL,5,
OL,6,FLate on Monday, Canada officials
OL,7,Fannounced a news conference on Tuesday
OL,8,Fwhere they would outline how the
OL,9,Fcountry would respond to the trade war
OL,10,Fand work to "protect and support
OL,11,FCanadian workers and businesses during
OL,12,Fthese challenging times".
